    "Owned properties display a persistent check-flag sign.",
    "One active job at a time.",
    "No world traversal gate depends on story progress.",
    "Manual garage and city checkpoint saves are disabled during active jobs. Loading is allowed after explicit confirmation and restores the saved checkpoint.",
