    "Five independent local commissions each pay 25 Coins and 2 scrap once, without production ticks.",
    "Rivet modes: maker 2 scrap to 30 Coins with reserve 4; recycler adds 2 scrap; runner adds 10 Coins. Modes snapshot at dispatch."
